    "collapsible_content_7y8TFD": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_GkJa8q": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How can I book 2 float appointments for the same time?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Absolutely! Choose the service and times you wish, and confirm online.</strong> <em>If you’re having any issues, please give us a call at +44 20 3871 3363 and we’ll help get these appointments booked in for you! </em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_pNAhXE": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is your cancellation policy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>We have a 24 hour cancellation process.</strong> If you have booked an appointment with us and need to reschedule, please let us know at least 24 hours before your scheduled time to avoid losing your float credit.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_GNmjGm": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is your refund or return policy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>We will refund for any reason within 14 days of purchase.</strong> Please reach out to us at info@floathub.co.uk to sort out any issues or concerns</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Q8qmTF": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are there reasons someone isn't able to float?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes.</p><p><strong>If you have recently dyed your hair or spray tanned the spray tan or hair dye can leak into the water and damage the float tanks.</strong> You want to make completely sure that no dye is coming out of your hair in the shower or on a towel after washing (usually within a few days to weeks depending on the treatment). Leave a minimum of 48 hours after a spray tan before floating.</p><p><strong>If you have a new tattoo you want to make sure it’s been at least 30 days</strong> (or your tattoo has fully healed) before floating as the salt water can cause painful burning.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_QNyGti": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are there any differences between the rooms?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No, each room is identical in the floatation tank, shower and amenities to provide you with the most premium float experience no matter which room you’re in!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_dqzEdk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What do I need to know for my appointment? Should I bring anything?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>When you book an appointment, you will receive an email</strong> that will provide some important information to prepare you for your first float with us. You can also review our page on <a href=\"https://floathub.co.uk/floating/\">float therapy</a> which has tips and recommendations to have the best experience!</p><p><em>We provide everything you need for your session. </em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_wKqe3z": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When should I arrive for my appointment?",
            "icon": "none",
